ent-FishHolopadRemoteTransmitter = advanced holopad
    .desc = A modified holopad transmitter. Once connected to a receiver, it streams the operator real-time audio and video of its surroundings.
    .suffix = Remote Transmitter

ent-FishHolopadRemoteReceiver = advanced holopad
    .desc = A modified holopad receiver. Gathers data on its surroundings and sends it to the connected transmitter.
    .suffix = Remote Receiver

